    {
      "t": "hide",
      "pos": "right"
    },
    {
      "t": "bgm",
      "src": "assets/audio/bgm/vol1_diner_ambient.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "interlude",
      "text": "cut",
      "sub": "INT. EDITING SUITE · Aud's · 4 a.m. · rolling",
      "duration": 2000
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Four in the morning in the editing suite. Four chairs. Coffee rings on everything."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Aud comes in with a pot of coffee, sleeves rolled, glasses on the chain, like it's any other morning."
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Aud",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "Who's on decaf."
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "The Human Being",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "None for me ginger beer thanks"
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "She pours anyway, into a cup that's already full, and it goes over and runs along the cables."
    },
    {
      "t": "cg",
      "src": "assets/cg/vol4_meld_facet_suite_coffee.jpg",
      "caption": "coffee, the deck, the monitors"
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "On the monitors, a bakery window. Hans lifting a loaf off a tray and setting it back, lifting it, setting it back."
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "The Director",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "Cut."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Hans lifts the loaf."
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "The Director",
      "expr": "angry",
      "text": "Cut. Cut."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Hans sets it back. On the next monitor minivan doors slide open and shut all down a street."
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "The Writer",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "Can't we just sit here and think a minute."
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Aud",
      "expr": "amused",
      "text": "Nobody leaves. That's the trouble with a good diner."
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "The Director",
      "expr": "angry",
      "text": "I said cut."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Nothing stops. The coffee finds the door and goes out under it, downhill."
    },
    {
      "t": "bg",
      "src": "assets/backgrounds/vol2_scumm_hemlock_vga.jpg"
    },
    {
      "t": "bgm",
      "src": "assets/audio/bgm/vol2_scumm_adlib.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "interlude",
      "text": "rolling",
      "sub": "Hemlock · sixteen colors · still rolling",
      "duration": 1800
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Out on Hemlock it runs in the gutter past the bakery. Hans calls after somebody going by."
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Hans",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "Bread for the morning. You'll want it later."
    },
    {
      "t": "bg",
      "src": "assets/backgrounds/vol3_editing_suite_night.jpg"
    },
    {
      "t": "bgm",
      "src": "assets/audio/bgm/vol1_diner_ambient.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "The Artist",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "A conspiracy of beautiful dreamers yet a conspiracy no less."
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Aud",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "Pay at the register."
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "The Human Being",
      "expr": "sad",
      "text": "It hurts to think this play has already started and I just now realize it must be completed."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "The Director takes his hand off the deck. The town keeps going without him."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Aud sets down the pot."
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Aud",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "It's the one you're going to make."
    },
    {
      "t": "flag",
      "key": "meld_facet_suite",
      "val": true
    },
